---
title: Incline Dumbbell Press (45°)
type: docs
prev: docs/grud/
---
![](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/00af12a1-f480-4cec-856c-9894ffc31300)

{{% steps %}}

### Step 1
Lie back on a bench set to a 45-degree incline, holding the dumbbells at chest level with your palms facing forward.

### Step 2
Take a deep breath and press the dumbbells straight up until your arms are fully extended. Exhale at the top.

### Step 3
Smoothly lower the weights back down to the starting position.

{{% /steps %}}

{{< callout type="info" >}}
Keep your elbows pointed out to the sides and moving in a straight vertical line to avoid straining your shoulders.
{{< /callout >}}
